From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeplatinum-3ds <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 11:30:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Main menu: skip the wireless search (SDK_PORT_3DS)

With a save, the main menu starts the DS wireless driver to look for a
Pokemon Ranger game, a Wii or a Mystery Gift distribution nearby.
WirelessDriver_Init stops the game (OS_Terminate) when the driver doesn't
start, and the port has no DS wireless, so Continue was never reached.
Skip the search, as if it found nobody.
---
 src/main_menu/main_menu.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/main_menu/main_menu.c b/src/main_menu/main_menu.c
--- a/src/main_menu/main_menu.c
+++ b/src/main_menu/main_menu.c
@@ -409,7 +409,14 @@
     case MAIN_MENU_WIRELESS_CHECK_IDLE:
         break;
     case MAIN_MENU_WIRELESS_CHECK_START:
+#ifdef SDK_PORT_3DS
+        // The port has no DS wireless (WVR_StartUpAsync isn't implemented,
+        // and WirelessDriver_Init stops the game if it fails), so there is
+        // nothing to find: skip the search, as if it found nobody.
+        appData->wirelessCheckState = MAIN_MENU_WIRELESS_CHECK_IDLE;
+#else
         appData->wirelessCheckState = MAIN_MENU_WIRELESS_CHECK_INIT_WIRELESS;
+#endif
         break;
     case MAIN_MENU_WIRELESS_CHECK_INIT_WIRELESS:
         CommManager_InitializeSearchParty(appData->saveData);
-- 
